   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Depending on the choice of the selectInput, I want different help texts displayed which are stored in a list <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">helpText</span>; another list <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">helpMethodConditions </span>holds the conditions.<br><br>I can manually add the panels:<br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><br>conditionalPanel(condition =  helpMethodConditions[[1]], helpText(helpMethod[[1]])),</span><br><br>but I was looking for a more elegant solution, so I thought of passing the list to conditions, but  could not get this to work.<br><br><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?fromgroups#!searchin/shiny-discuss/multiple/shiny-discuss/fm0yERuNkIA/eiD19ePqcK0J\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?fromgroups%23!searchin/shiny-discuss/multiple/shiny-discuss/fm0yERuNkIA/eiD19ePqcK0J&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408382163000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xzQ36F10_mZcDy954eur3\">conditional Panels and Lists Forum Thread</a><br><br>Example see: <br><br><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/dmenne/5771880\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/dmenne/5771880&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408382163000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3e0Sozh1L9cqihGBrLNTdP\">https://gist.github.com/dmenne/5771880</a><br><br><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:blue\">shiny::runGist(&quot;5771880&quot;)<br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">I also tried a solution based on the indexed form </span><br><br></span></pre></span><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/5616777\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/5616777&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408382163000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PtauELUs80wpcuVnYtagp\">https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/5616777</a><br><br>but could not get the syntax right.<br>"
